# Trial-Size Trial by Earth (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_earth): entryRequirement. Main, a level 20 Warrior with the quest accepted and
# the MiniTuningForkOfEarth: EP_Entrance: not a Summoner: no options: the default. bob, a level 19 Summoner: below 20: no options.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrade
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=WAR lvl=20
char bob zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=19
quest Bastok.TrialSizeTrialByEarth accepted
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfEarth
bob: item MiniTuningForkOfEarth
login
trade EP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfEarth x1  # not a Summoner: no options
bob: login
bob: trade EP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfEarth x1  # level 19: no options
